  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Liberia: Enhancing People-Centred Justice Service Delivery</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1) To increase the capacity of the Court Inspectorate Unit and prosecution monitors to carry out effective monitoring, reporting, and oversight functions. 2) To increase the capacity of the Press and Public Affairs sections of justice institutions to improve citizens&#x2019; awareness of the existence, functions, and access to integrity and accountability mechanisms.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Direct beneficiaries: The Judiciary and the Ministry of Justice.Indirect beneficiaries: Communities in Liberia.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aimed to support the Government of Liberia in improving people-centred justice service delivery in the country.</narrative>
  </description>
